This project is an independent accessibility tool for Mortal Kombat X
(Steam, MK10.exe). It does not modify the game or its files. It takes screenshots of
the running game's window, recognises the screen, and speaks its menus through
a screen reader or the Windows voice.

It contains no code from the game. The known_screens/ folder holds small
screenshots of the game's menus, used only so the reader can recognise those
screens.

